<%layout("/layouts/boilerplate.ejs")-%>

<div class="container my-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-9">

        <h1 class="mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted">Last Updated: October 2026</p>

        <p>
            At TripNest, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting
            the information you provide while using our platform.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4">Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
            When you create an account or use TripNest, we may collect information
            such as your username, email address, listing information, reviews,
            and other information that you voluntarily provide.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4">How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>The information collected may be used to:</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Create and manage your account</li>
            <li>Allow you to create and manage listings</li>
            <li>Display reviews and listing information</li>
            <li>Provide authentication and account-related features</li>
            <li>Improve the functionality and user experience of TripNest</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="mt-4">Listing and Review Information</h2>
        <p>
            Information that you submit through listings and reviews may be visible
            to other users of the platform. Please avoid submitting sensitive or
            private information in public listings or reviews.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4">Images</h2>
        <p>
            Images uploaded to TripNest may be stored using third-party cloud
            storage services and displayed as part of listings on the platform.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4">Cookies and Sessions</h2>
        <p>
            TripNest may use sessions and cookies to maintain authentication and
            provide features such as login status and user sessions.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
            TripNest may use third-party services for features such as image
            storage, maps, geocoding, and authentication. These services may
            process information according to their own privacy policies.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4">Data Security</h2>
        <p>
            We take reasonable measures to protect information stored on the
            platform. However, no online system can guarantee complete security.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4">Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>
            This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time. Any changes
            will be reflected on this page.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4">Contact</h2>
        <p>
            If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact the
            TripNest project team.
        </p>

    </div>
</div>

</div>
